# Every Metal library with a function on iPadOS 17.7.11 (21H461)'s OS volume (the IPSW's 044-76040-038.dmg, @ipsw_os), by
# its path below the volume's root: what @gpu_apple_libs extracts (bazel/gpu/deps.bzl) and m2v's library index covers
# (names.json, //gpu:library_names). The OS cryptex holds no other: its QuartzCore default.metallib is this one, byte for
# byte, and its SafariSharedUI one has no function. Regenerate (the image attached read-only at /Volumes/X):
#   bazel run //out/native-a57/root-v1/tree/drivers/TegraGM20BMetal:libraries -- pins /Volumes/X > $PWD/bazel/gpu/apple-libs.sha256
